silm:instances_papers_15_chapters_01_sections_01_concrete_anchor_apex#mittensthecatasleepontheradiator silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensTheCatAsleepOnTheRadiator is The single governed individual: the cat asleep on the radiator. Mittens is the same cat on 2026-04-12 (vet visit), 2026-04-19 (microchip read), and 2026-04-26 (dietary card). Mittens is NOT the union of all records about Mittens; it is the colimit apex of the directed system of source diagrams." .
